## Open Core Model

This project follows an open core model:
- The **core** (this repository) is source-available for study and personal use
- **Premium features** are available under a separate commercial license
- No contributions are accepted at this time

## Premium Features (not included in this repository)
- Multi-user support
- Team collaboration
- Advanced analytics
- Cloud sync across devices
- Priority support

## No Contributions

This project is not accepting contributions at this time. Pull requests will be
closed without review. If you have suggestions, please open an issue for
discussion only.

